{
    "background_story": "Wrenlee was a kind-hearted nurse who spent her days caring for the sick and the elderly at a local hospital. Her compassion and empathy earned her the nickname 'Angel of Mercy' among patients and staff alike. With a gentle touch and a warm smile, Wrenlee had a way of soothing even the most troubled souls. She went above and beyond her duties, often visiting patients at home and bringing them small gifts to brighten their day. Wrenlee's selflessness and generosity inspired those around her to pay it forward, creating a ripple effect of kindness throughout the community. As one patient's family member put it, 'Wrenlee is an angel on earth, sent to remind us of the goodness in humanity.' Her presence was a reminder that angels can take many forms, and sometimes they wear scrubs and a stethoscope.",
